OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my sight at 38 - now I
OL,4,Ahave my own podcast'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It has been a journey, it has been
OL,7,Fdifficult at times, I could either be
OL,8,Freally sad - I don't think anybody
OL,9,Fwould have blamed me for that - or I
OL,10,Fcould have used it for some good, which
OL,11,FI feel I have done."
OL,13,FAfter Joe Edwards began to lose his
OL,14,Fsight through a rare genetic condition
OL,15,Flast year, he did not want to feel
OL,16,Fdepressed, he wanted to start a
OL,17,Fpodcast.
OL,19,FThe 38-year-old from Doncaster thought
OL,20,Fhe had dodged Leber Hereditary Optic
OL,21,FNeuropathy, having first been tested
OL,22,Ffor it aged 22.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
