OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my sight at 38 - now I
OL,4,Ahave my own podcast'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut his vision started to deteriorate
OL,7,Flast May and a few weeks later he was
OL,8,Ftold that he did have the condition and
OL,9,Fwould gradually lose his vision.
